{"spans":[{"text":"I have unfinished business and unfulfilled promises..."}]},{"spans":[{"text":"Things are immensely difficult, but I like it here."}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"NPC-Batou","expression":0,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"Batou","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"You know full well..."}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"NPC-Batou","expression":0,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"Batou","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"The Dolls can also feel the same way, but you're just ignoring that possibility and making the decision for them?"}]}]},{"sprites":[],"ops":[],"speaker":"Commander","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"...I don't want them to suffer so much."}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"NPC-Batou","expression":0,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"Batou","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"I get that."}]},{"spans":[{"text":"I know a kid who had it really rough. Luckily she's really smart, and she got a PhD at MIT when she was just 19."}]},{"spans":[{"text":"She could have done anything with her life, but she gave it all up and chose to go down the darkest, hardest path..."}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"NPC-Batou","expression":0,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[{"type":"darken","raw":"同时置暗"}],"speaker":"Commander","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"..."}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"NPC-Batou","expression":0,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"Batou","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"I also wanted her to live a happy and carefree life, but that's not what she wanted."}]}]},{"sprites":[],"ops":[],"speaker":null,"narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"Batou shakes his head and chuckles helplessly as he recalls the girl's stubbornness."}]}]},{"sprites":[],"ops":[{"type":"sfx","value":"AVG_20Winter_Drink_Tea","raw":"SE1"}],"speaker":null,"narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"The Commander downs the remaining contents in their glass and feels the burn in their throat."}]}]},{"sprites":[],"ops":[],"speaker":"Commander","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"I understand... how that feels..."}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"NPC-Batou","expression":2,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"Batou","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"It's natural to want happiness for those you care about."}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"NPC-Batou","expression":0,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"Batou","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"But sometimes, we make decisions not necessarily because they will lead us to happiness but simply because that's what we genuinely want."}]},{"spans":[{"text":"Even if it means causing pain and suffering to ourselves."}]}]},{"sprites":[],"ops":[],"speaker":"Commander","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"You're right..."}]}]},{"sprites":[],"ops":[],"speaker":null,"narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"The two share another drink in silence. The silence once again fills the room."}]}]},{"sprites":[],"ops":[],"speaker":null,"narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"Kusanagi walks over from the window, picks up the bottle on the table and drains its contents."}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"NPC-Motoko","expression":0,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{"spritePosition":"-40,130"}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"Motoko Kusanagi","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"So, Commander, what are you planning to do?"}]}]},{"sprites":[],"ops":[],"speaker":"Commander","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"..."}]},{"spans":[{"text":"I'm going to rescue Boys..."}]},{"spans":[{"text":"Then I'll proceed with the original plan and restore the Dolls' memories."}]},{"spans":[{"text":"...I'll let them tell me what they want."}]}]},{"sprites":[],"ops":[{"type":"blackscreenOn","raw":"黑屏1"},{"type":"bgm","value":"BGM_Empty","raw":"BGM"}],"speaker":null,"narrator":false,"pages":[]},{"spr