m sorry for not doing this with your consent, but I need to monitor your bio signs."}]},{"spans":[{"text":"You are currently logging into Sector 2Z64 via a simulated cyberbrain, which is still in the testing phase. Miss Mizukane says that your connection with Sector 2Z64 will gradually deteriorate."}]},{"spans":[{"text":"That's why I must monitor your sensory data regularly every day."}]}]},{"sprites":[],"ops":[{"type":"fadePointOn","raw":"黑点1"}],"speaker":null,"narrator":false,"pages":[]},{"sprites":[],"ops":[{"type":"fadePointOff","raw":"黑点2"},{"type":"flashback","raw":"回忆"},{"type":"background","value":"black","raw":"BIN"}],"speaker":null,"narrator":false,"pages":[]},{"sprites":[],"ops":[],"speaker":"Suzuka Mizukane","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"...What you experience with the simulated cyberbrain may feel very realistic, but as time goes by, your sensory input will deteriorate."}]},{"spans":[{"text":"With a cyberbrain, you won't have this problem."}]}]},{"sprites":[],"ops":[{"type":"fadePointOn","raw":"黑点1"}],"speaker":null,"narrator":false,"pages":[]},{"sprites":[],"ops":[{"type":"fadePointOff","raw":"黑点2"},{"type":"closeMask","raw":"关闭蒙版"},{"type":"background","value":"2021summer_Street","raw":"BIN"}],"speaker":null,"narrator":false,"pages":[]},{"sprites":[],"ops":[],"speaker":"Commander","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"..."}]},{"spans":[{"text":"What symptoms will I experience when the connection deteriorates?"}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"NPC-HK433","expression":0,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{"spritePosition":"0,130"}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"No. 390","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"According to the previous experiment reports, it begins with vision loss. Your vision will become blurry, like you're losing pixels."}]},{"spans":[{"text":"Then you will experience hearing loss. Sounds will gradually become more and more distorted until they sound like compressed sharp ringing."}]},{"spans":[{"text":"Finally, the last to go will be your sense of touch, though by the time you reach this stage, your connection will no longer be able to sustain your activities in Sector 2Z64."}]}]},{"sprites":[],"ops":[],"speaker":"Commander","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"..."}]}]},{"sprites":[],"ops":[],"speaker":null,"narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"The Commander gazes at the cherry blossoms dancing in the air. Even though they know full well that they are nothing but simulated illusions, they still can't help but be moved when their fingertips touch the delicate petals."}]}]},{"sprites":[],"ops":[],"speaker":"Commander","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"How long do I have until I start developing these symptoms?"}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"NPC-HK433","expression":2,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{"spritePosition":"0,130"}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"No. 390","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"The deterioration process has already begun from the very moment you first got here."}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"NPC-HK433","expression":2,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{"spritePosition":"0,130"}}],"ops":[{"type":"darken","raw":"同时置暗"}],"speaker":"Commander","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"..."}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"NPC-HK433","expression":0,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{"spritePosition":"0,130"}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"No. 390","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"Don't worry, I'll stay by your side and keep a close eye on your physical condition."}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"NPC-HK433","expression":0,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{"spritePosition":"0,130"}}],"ops":[{"type":"darken","raw":"同时置暗"}],"speaker":"Commander","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"You don't have to follow me around. I'd like to be alone for a while."}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"NPC-HK433","expression":0,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{"spritePosition":"0,130"}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"No. 390","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"..."