ce to choose between living in a ruthless reality and an ideal virtual world, which would you choose?"}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"NPC-HK433","expression":4,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{"spritePosition":"0,130"}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"No. 390","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"A ruthless... reality?"}]}]},{"sprites":[],"ops":[],"speaker":null,"narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"No. 390 looks around at the clean and peaceful street in perplexity."}]}]},{"sprites":[],"ops":[],"speaker":"Commander","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"Uh... Imagine if you were living in a chaotic world filled with danger and conspiracy."}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"NPC-HK433","expression":0,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{"spritePosition":"0,130"}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"No. 390","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"Right, I was born and grew up in a dark and dangerous world..."}]}]},{"sprites":[],"ops":[],"speaker":"Commander","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"Then a new world opened its doors to you. It was a peaceful and lovely place, just like Sector 2Z64, except it was a virtual world."}]},{"spans":[{"text":"Now, you're given a choice—you could either continue to stay in the dark reality, or you could enter the beautiful virtual world."}]},{"spans":[{"text":"Which would you choose?"}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"NPC-HK433","expression":2,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{"spritePosition":"0,130"}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"No. 390","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"..."}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"NPC-HK433","expression":2,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{"spritePosition":"0,130"}}],"ops":[{"type":"darken","raw":"同时置暗"}],"speaker":null,"narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"No. 390 ponders the question earnestly. She remains silent for a long time."}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"NPC-HK433","expression":0,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{"spritePosition":"0,130"}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"No. 390","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"I cannot answer this question."}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"NPC-HK433","expression":0,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{"spritePosition":"0,130"}}],"ops":[{"type":"darken","raw":"同时置暗"}],"speaker":"Commander","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"Why not?"}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"NPC-HK433","expression":0,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{"spritePosition":"0,130"}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"No. 390","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"It would depend on what my life was like in the real world."}]},{"spans":[{"text":"Whether I had what I wanted; if I was happy..."}]},{"spans":[{"text":"And whether the virtual world could give me what I really wanted."}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"NPC-HK433","expression":0,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{"spritePosition":"0,130"}}],"ops":[{"type":"darken","raw":"同时置暗"}],"speaker":"Commander","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"Then what is it that you really want?"}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"NPC-HK433","expression":2,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{"spritePosition":"0,130"}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"No. 390","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"..."}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"NPC-HK433","expression":2,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{"spritePosition":"0,130"}}],"ops":[{"type":"darken","raw":"同时置暗"}],"speaker":"Commander","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"Or rather, what is your purpose in life?"}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"NPC-HK433","expression":2,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{"spritePosition":"0,130"}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"No. 390","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"..."}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"NPC-HK433","expression":2,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{"spritePosition":"0,130"}}],"ops":[{"type":"darken","raw":"同时置暗"}],"speaker":"Commander","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"What's wrong? You don't look very well all of a sudden..."}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"NPC-HK433","expression":3,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{"spritePosit